          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-img">🍫</div>
          <div class="product-card-body">
            <h3>Dark Chocolate PB Cups</h3>
            <p class="product-desc">Rich dark chocolate with creamy peanut butter filling</p>
            <span class="product-price">$3.49</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-card-img">🍝</div>
          <div class="product-card-body">
